# Tempo environment variables
# Copy to .env (or set these in your host's dashboard, e.g. Cloudflare Pages
# or Vercel). Only VITE_-prefixed vars reach the browser, and they are meant
# to be public: the Supabase anon key is safe to ship because Row Level
# Security, not secrecy, protects the data.

# --- Supabase (accounts + shared leaderboard) ---------------------------
# Settings > API in your Supabase dashboard. Leave both empty to run in
# local-only mode (progress on localStorage, leaderboards per device).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Stripe (checkout) --------------------------------------------------
# Your Stripe Payment Link URL (Products > Payment Links). Set its
# after-payment redirect to  https://YOUR-DOMAIN/app/?checkout=success
# so the app unlocks on return. Overrides the STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK constant
# in the code when present. Empty = access-code flow only.
VITE_STRIPE_LINK=

# --- Server-only secrets (NEVER prefix these with VITE_) -----------------
# These live in Supabase Edge Function secrets, not in this file and not in
# the browser bundle. Listed only as a reminder of what the Stripe webhook
# needs (see supabase/README.md):
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY
#   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
